  "description": "A powerful extension toolkit for SqlSugar ORM. Provides a flexible client factory with easy configuration (singleton/scope), integrates Yitter SnowFlake ID generator, and offers rich extension methods for SimpleClient and ISugarQueryable. Simplifies common data access patterns like paging, array conversion, and attribute-based entity mapping.",
  "id": "SqlSugarUtility",
  "isPrerelease": false,
